足一捆。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沒有一個路過的人說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「願耶和華賜福給你們！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們奉耶和華的名祝福你們。」","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/129.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/130.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/128.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}